959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">All-Inclusive Collection - Hard Rock Hotels<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Azul Hotels<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Breathless Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Casa Velas<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Dreams Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">El Dorado Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\">Garza Blanca Resorts<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=