","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5d7d98ff60fdcf78844a44a28b55787","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;we have visited all the royalton resorts and are one of their top agencies. It is a great resort brand that is offering a wide range of accommodations and resorts amenities that work perfectly for a wedding. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know if you have any specific information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@TApatty was there recently.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895069,"PostDate":1430485055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we have visited all the royalton resorts and are one of their top agencies. It is a great resort brand that is offering a wide range of accommodations and resorts amenities that work perfectly for a wedding. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let us know if you have any specific information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@TApatty was there recently.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><