I mean about ten to fifteen people. I want to have music, food, open bar. How do I keep the party started with a small group? Who has done a small wedding.?\n\nThank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1899071,"PostDate":1435000851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone<br>\nI'm thinking of doing a small destination wedding. When I say small, I mean about ten to fifteen people. I want to have music, food, open bar. How do I keep the party started with a small group? Who has done a small wedding.?<br>\nThank you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hjacobus1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.222.121.236","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435000426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Heidz1234","Id":283644,"Name":"Heidz1234","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79304,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5da0e5c236fdabbfb9a3c7c2fed86d32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Dear@[member=\"Heidz1234\"],&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;We have an option for smaller wedding groups that is not only fun but also affordable. One of the options is for groups up to 10 people including bride and groom, and we also have another one that can easily accomodate the 15-17 people total you mentioned. Our venue is one of the top wedding locations in Mexico: a private beach at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta called Las Caletas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;If you would like to know more you can go to our website&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(84,141,212);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;to find more about the packages we have or call our Toll free number.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81579]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81550]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80966]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#4a442a;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Toll free 1 866 731 8152&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#548dd4;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Phone: +52 (322) 297.1212 ext. 1468&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900535,"PostDate":1436980796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Dear@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283644\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283644-heidz1234\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Heidz1234<\/span><\/a>,<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">We have an option for smaller wedding groups that is not only fun but also affordable. One of the options is for groups up to 10 people including bride and groom, and we also have another one that can easily accomodate the 15-17 people total you mentioned. Our venue is one of the top wedding locations in Mexico: a private beach at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta called Las Caletas.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">If you would like to know more you can go to our website\u00a0<\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(84,141,212)\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">\u00a0to find more about the packages we have or call our Toll free number.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Thank you!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81579-chair-bows\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_190186.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Chair bows'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Chair bows' id='sml_image_view_81579' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81550-best-destination-wedding-for-our-adventure\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18067\/sml_gallery_258213_18067_1800768.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Best destination wedding for our adventure'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Best destination wedding for our adventure' id='sml_image_view_81550' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80966-awcr-04042014-439\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_170869.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='awcr 04042014 439'  width='200' height='134'  alt='awcr 04042014 439' id='sml_image_view_80966' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#4a442a\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Adventure Weddings<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Toll free 1 866 731 8152<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#548dd4\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Phone: +52 (322) 297.1212 ext. 1468<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"L