> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1050,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1878423,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280942,"Name":"flaca313","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1415986181,"LastPoster":{"Id":283948,"Name":"adrianaportela07","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1878423,"PostDate":1415986181,"PostContent":"My head is spinning from reading resort reviews, researching different islands, until finally dec...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tbschwager@optonline.net","IpAddress":"74.105.47.64","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414778255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"flaca313","Id":280942,"Name":"flaca313","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.8.199.97","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78381,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7803e00bb65b7b0cdb90ee08781582b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My head is spinning from reading resort reviews, researching different islands, until finally deciding on Punta Cana (we have been here twice before and LOVE it), but now more factors are coming into play. People are concerned about getting sick because of the water (speaking of this, have any past brides had issues with the water and guests getting sick? This really does make me a little nervous), for example and in any case, I just can&#039;t figure out how to choose one resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyway, after my million spreadsheets containing resort ratings, amenities, etc. I think I&#039;ve narrowed it down to 5 with Paradisus Resorts in the lead at the moment:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) Paradisus Palma Real and\/or Paradisus Punta Cana&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) Iberostar Resorts&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) Now Larimar&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4) Riu Resorts&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5) Dreams Resorts&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A few points - a casino was a MUST for the groom and there will be over 100 guests ages 3 to 85! We would like nightlife since a majority of the guests will be between 25-35. I guess my question to you is - how did you pick where you were going to get married? Did anyone go to Punta Cana and just go visit a bunch of resorts? I&#039;m just trying to figure out the best way to go about this. Any help - greatly appreciated because I feel like my head is going to explode....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878423,"PostDate":1415986181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My head is spinning from reading resort reviews, researching different islands, until finally deciding on Punta Cana (we have been here twice before and LOVE it), but now more factors are coming into play. People are concerned about getting sick because of the water (speaking of this, have any past brides had issues with the water and guests getting sick? This really does make me a little nervous), for example and in any case, I just can't figure out how to choose one resort!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyway, after my million spreadsheets containing resort ratings, amenities, etc. I think I've narrowed it down to 5 with Paradisus Resorts in the lead at the moment:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) Paradisus Palma Real and\/or Paradisus Punta Cana<\/p>\n<p>2) Iberostar Resorts<\/p>\n<p>3) Now Larimar<\/p>\n<p>4) Riu Resorts<\/p>\n<p>5) Dreams Resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A few points - a casino was a MUST for the groom and there will be over 100 guests ages 3 to 85! We would like nightlife since a majority of the guests will be between 25-35. I guess my question to you is - how did you pick where you were going to get married? Did anyone go to Punta Cana and just go visit a bunch of resorts? I'm just trying to figure out the best way to go about this. Any help - greatly appreciated because I feel like my head is going to explode....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tbschwager@optonline.net","IpAddress":"74.105.47.64","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414778255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"flaca313","Id":280942,"Name":"flaca313","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78381,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61bfc7525a2721fac51250d1e41b8854","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"flaca313\"]!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m getting married at Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe.&amp;nbsp; We didn&#039;t take a trip and visit a bunch of resorts, but if you can afford it you may want to - even if it&#039;s just an excuse to take a vacation!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m very happy with my choice as it has something for everyone.&amp;nbsp; We have a lot of people of all ages (my niece will turn 1 the day after we arrive and some of my older aunts\/uncles are coming) so we needed something family friendly with lots to do and at a reasonable price.&amp;nbsp; Initially we were in talks with Paradisus Palma Real but found it was too expensive for our guests.&amp;nbsp; Our travel agent helped break down a few resorts and we decided based on costs and amenities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as the water - we are advised not to drink it!&amp;nbsp; Only use bottled water.&amp;nbsp; They say you can brush your teeth with it, but my fiance decided to stay safe and use bottled water for that too....kind of a pain but it&#039;s not the end of the world.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck making your decision!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878644,"PostDate":1416315854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280942\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280942-flaca313\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">flaca313<\/span><\/a>!\u00a0 I'm getting married at Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe.\u00a0 We didn't take a trip and visit a bunch of resorts, but if you can afford it you may want to - even if it's just an excuse to take a vacation!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm very happy with my choice as it has something for everyone.\u00a0 We have a lot of people of all ages (my niece will turn 1 the day after we arrive and some of my older aunts\/uncles are coming) so we needed something family friendly with lots to do and at a reasonable price.\u00a0 Initially we were in talks with Paradisus Palma Real but found it was too expensive for our guests.\u00a0 Our travel agent helped break down a few resorts and we decided based on costs and amenities.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as the water - we are advised not to drink it!\u00a0 Only use bottled water.\u00a0 They say you can brush your teeth with it, but my fiance decided to stay safe and use bottled water for that too....kind of a pain but it's not the end of the world.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck making your decision!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenique.brown@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411557695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JJCB0418","Id":279978,"Name":"JJCB0418","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.206.77.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78381,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da95fb6d5cc509a4d4fe27e8fda08507","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just wanted to thank you for your response! We booked teh paradisus Palma Real for 8\/19\/16. So excited!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880093,"PostDate":1418231034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just wanted to thank you for your response! We booked teh paradisus Palma Real for 8\/19\/16. So excited!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tbschwager@optonline.net","IpAddress":"74.105.47.64","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414778255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"flaca313","Id":280942,"Name":"flaca313","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.192.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78381,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc1a9ef4806ed5a7a41a05059daa6b23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;yayyy congrats!!&amp;nbsp; When we went for our site visit to BBPD in September we spoke to some people that attended a wedding their a few years ago and they said it was absolu