ons Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"129.49.183.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76060f3a23bfeb46386caf70dacd382d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;There is a fb group called Royalton Punta Cana Brides. I got married their 4\/8\/2015 and the group helped a whole lot!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895682,"PostDate":1431015407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>There is a fb group called Royalton Punta Cana Brides. I got married their 4\/8\/2015 and the group helped a whole lot!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lillianvldz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"129.49.183.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431015238,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283017.jpg?_r=1431982446","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"larubia","Id":283017,"Name":"larubia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"186.6.199.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78926bf3183bf878ca23db7e871fe464","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone ,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just letting you know you can book our services for The Royalton , you don\u00b4t need to pay a vendor fee ,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Contact us at:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;info@manniapuntacana.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898096,"PostDate":1433774178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone ,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just letting you know you can book our services for The Royalton , you don\u00b4t need to pay a vendor fee ,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Contact us at:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>info@manniapuntacana.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx'>DJ SERVICE CANCUN ,RIVIERA MAYA ,MX , PUNTA CANA D.R.<br \/>\nhttp:\/\/www.manniacancun.com.mx<\/a>","Email":"carlosmartinez@manniacancun.com.mx","IpAddress":"187.153.96.158","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238554740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216337.jpg?_r=1393909989","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DJMannia","Id":216337,"Name":"DJMannia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.98.6.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79133,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc08f6bb31ab52183dd2e497dec908d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at&amp;nbsp;the Royalton in 2017. Does anyone have the different wedding packages we could look at? thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900549,"PostDate":1436993472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\