{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45e24a1c67d8133812fc5ab21bd12c77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m giddy - went to the NOW site today and on the wedding&#039;s page, my date now shows as &#039;partially booked&#039; (it was wide open before!!!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But a question - does anyone have Yeomandry as their coordinator? I was dealing with Michelle MacPherson at first (who was AMAZING in answering questions and getting us booked) but now I&#039;m worried - Michelle was so great at responding, and I don&#039;t know what to expect from Yeomandry.....&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864891,"PostDate":1407342897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm giddy - went to the NOW site today and on the wedding's page, my date now shows as 'partially booked' (it was wide open before!!!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But a question - does anyone have Yeomandry as their coordinator? I was dealing with Michelle MacPherson at first (who was AMAZING in answering questions and getting us booked) but now I'm worried - Michelle was so great at responding, and I don't know what to expect from Yeomandry.....\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb952aba58b251f58fe62f51da1bbe84","RawContent":"I need to book my time soon, I&#039;m considering paying the 100 dollars to book the \"free\" wedding and then in a few weeks being like never mind I want the divine package and paying the difference! Has anyone done this?","Attachments":[],"Id":1864916,"PostDate":1407353716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I need to book my time soon, I'm considering paying the 100 dollars to book the \"free\" wedding and then in a few weeks being like never mind I want the divine package and paying the difference! Has anyone done this?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.11.81.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e67b6537d2933b68fca1359af32340e","RawContent":"Hey everyone!\n\n\nWe&#039;re booked for May 1st, 2015 @ Now, fountain ceremony and pool reception!  \n\n\nWe have Luisa as our WC and so far has been good, but can take days for responses.  Like a lot have said on the threads, they deal with 3 weddings a day so our weddings aren&#039;t top priority this many months ahead of time (unfortunately!)\n\n\nLove connecting with people to try and figure this whole thing out so by all means message :)\n\n\nHappy planning, \n\nDana","Attachments":[],"Id":1864962,"PostDate":1407399115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone!<br><br>\nWe're booked for May 1st, 2015 @ Now, fountain ceremony and pool reception!  <br><br>\nWe have Luisa as our WC and so far has been good, but can take days for responses.  Like a lot have said on the threads, they deal with 3 weddings a day so our weddings aren't top priority this many months ahead of time (unfortunately!)<br><br>\nLove connecting with people to try and figure this whole thing out so by all means message <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nHappy planning, <br>\nDana\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danamarielouise@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.89.226.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393261367,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Danamarielouise","Id":276863,"Name":"Danamarielouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.173.225.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4383687a665e3cf92dff4f7e5c6bf7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re booked for July 24, 2015 @ Now Larimar.&amp;nbsp; We are having our ceremony at the Fountain and the reception at the Pool!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s still a year away, but I&#039;m so excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865053,"PostDate":1407422341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're booked for July 24, 2015 @ Now Larimar.\u00a0 We are having our ceremony at the Fountain and the reception at the Pool!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's still a year away, but I'm so excited!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ritagardner@earthlink.net","IpAddress":"199.173.225.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407422015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279351.jpg?_r=1422475580","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rmg428","Id":279351,"Name":"rmg428","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"472756a1252367da668e56c485d30c0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone decided what they are going to do for centerpieces?&amp;nbsp; Are you just going to pay them for them, or are you going to diy and bring them with you.&amp;nbsp; When I asked about simple centerpieces that would be 3 candles at different levels they told me that would be 100 dollars per table?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865060,"PostDate":1407424508,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone decided what they are going to do for centerpieces?\u00a0 Are you just going to pay them for them, or are you going to diy and bring them with you.\u00a0 When I asked about simple centerpieces that would be 3 candles at different levels they told me that would be 100 dollars per table?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93cfee2940114eeac1c91d2fbffcf83e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"alwalters625\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think I&#039;m bringing mine with me - I&#039;m debating either doing a coloured plastic charger plate with sand, shells, tea lights and a lantern in the middle, or a plastic floating candle bowl. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t justify the resort cost for centrepieces.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will probably bring tablecloths\/runners\/or draping fabric for the centre too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What I have heard other brides do is rent the vase from the resort and put the bridal party bouquets in during the reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865069,"PostDate":1407429453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think I'm bringing mine with me - I'm debating either doing a coloured plastic charger plate with sand, shells, tea lights and a lantern in the middle, or a plastic floating candle bowl. \u00a0I can't justify the resort cost for centrepieces.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will probably bring tablecloths\/runners\/or draping fabric for the centre too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What I have heard other brides do is rent the vase from the resort and put the bridal party bouquets in during the reception?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelann25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406568944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279198.jpg?_r=1415031085","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAT2015","Id":279198,"Name":"KAT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d38e14628e8b204862ef3e951e48e036","RawContent":"@[member=\"alwalters625\"] \n\n\nwe are going to pay for ours, personally I don&#039;t think there worth $65 each but I just can&#039;t imagine traveling with 10-12 glass vases. They are pretty expensive with pricing!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1865077,"PostDate":1407432539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a> <br><br>\nwe are going to pay for ours, personally I don't think there worth $65 each but I just can't imagine traveling with 10-12 glass vases. They are pretty expensive with pricing!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e7a86234d6fe04a7c81f3fb5d8262d6","RawContent":"@[member=\"KAT2015\"] and @[member=\"DR2015\"] I know they are so expensive, Kat we are thinking of doing the same, bowl with beads water and floating candles, and just packing them since we will most likely fly southwest. DR2015, if I needed that many centerpieces I would probably just pay for them as well, we only invited 35 though so I&#039;m thinking 3-4 tables\/centerpieces","Attachments":[],"Id":1865088,"PostDate":1407436850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279198\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279198-kat2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KAT2015<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272393\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272393-dr2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DR2015<\/span><\/a> I know they are so expensive, Kat we are thinking of doing the same, bowl with beads water and floating candles, and just packing them since we will most likely fly southwest. DR2015, if I needed that many centerpieces I would probably just pay for them as well, we only invited 35 though so I'm thinking 3-4 tables\/centerpieces\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d2017f9e4a77b9e68b427aca8e01f17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"alwalters625\"] wow 35??!! that is amazing we were hoping for a small wedding but he and I both being the first and probably only children to get married on both sides, he the only boy of 4 and I the only girl of 4 every family member is making it a priority to be present. I initially went in with the hope of 45-50 people. Were at 53 booked and invitations just went out.. &amp;nbsp; :wacko:&amp;nbsp; :wacko:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865242,"PostDate":1407511156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a> wow 35??!! that is amazing we were hoping for a small wedding but he and I both being the first and probably only children to get married on both sides, he the only boy of 4 and I the only girl of 4 every family member is making it a priority to be present. I initially went in with the hope of 45-50 people. Were at 53 booked and invitations just went out.. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.59.207.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77311,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0aa14b3c315f697fe05059918418b001","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DR2015\" post=\"1865242\" timestamp=\"1407525556\"]\n@[member=\"alwalters625\"] wow 35??!! that is amazing we were hoping for a small wedding but he and I both being the first and probably only children to get married on both sides, he the only boy of 4 and I the only girl of 4 every family member is making it a priority to be present. I initially went in with the hope of 45-50 people. Were at 53 booked and invitations just went out..   :wacko:  :wacko:[\/quote]Yeah, it helps that I only have one brother and he only has one sister.  We wanted super small and intimiate as I get kinda shy when all the attention is on me.  We kept it as immediate family and close friends.  I am going to go ahead and send out invitations anyways, but we already will know who is coming as we set up a group package and got a great rate for anyone who pays their hundred dollar deposit soon!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1865268,"PostDate":1407527850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DR2015, on 08 August 2014 - 03:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279112-alwalters625\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">alwalters625<\/span><\/a> wow 35??!! that is amazing we were hoping for a small wedding but he and I both being the first and probably only children to get married on both sides, he the only boy of 4 and I the only girl of 4 every family member is making it a priority to be present. I initially went in with the hope of 45-50 people. Were at 53 booked and invitations just went out.. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yeah, it helps that I only have one brother and he only has one sister.\u00a0 We wanted super small and intimiate as I get kinda shy when all the attention is on me.\u00a0 We kept it as immediate family and close friends.\u00a0 I am going to go ahead and send out invitations anyways, but we already will know who is coming as we set up a group package and got a great rate for anyone who pays their hundred dollar deposit soon!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":199,"TotalPages":20,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":190},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
